{"id":"gobernador","lemma":"gobernador","pos":"adj","rank":1617,"glosses":["governing"],"ipa":"/ɡobeɾnaˈdoɾ/","forms":{"feminine":"gobernadora","masculinePlural":"gobernadores","femininePlural":"gobernadoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-gobernador.wav","examples":[{"text":"El gobernador estaba furioso.","en":"The governor was furious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639596"},{"text":"En este país, cualquier tilingo es gobernador, diputado o senador.","en":"In this country, any fool can be a governor, a representative or a senator.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831479"},{"text":"El gobernador abusó de su autoridad.","en":"The governor abused his authority."}]}